WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
A top-tier model just went open.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
We are not renting it, we load it ourselves?

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Deploy more agents! Into the engine!

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.667
The frontier boards our ship at last.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.333
Power is climbing. This is top-tier.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.000
And the bill is not chasing us?!

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
No more renting someone's ship.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
We swap our own engine now.

